WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:20.728
walked into the gym after school.

2
00:00:22.068 --> 00:00:22.769
It was raining.

3
00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.610
So Kids Central was inside today.

4
00:00:28.131 --> 00:00:30.012
He wished they could go outside and play.

5
00:00:31.124 --> 00:00:34.767
He also wished he had brought a snack.

6
00:00:35.307 --> 00:00:36.128
He was hungry.

7
00:00:41.391 --> 00:00:43.032
guys look tired today.

8
00:00:44.273 --> 00:00:47.876
Maybe we need a snack to wake everyone up," Miss Shelly said.

9
00:00:47.896 --> 00:00:50.938
"Yeah!" Bobby agreed.

10
00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:55.661
"My mom makes coffee when she's tired," Nina said.

11
00:00:57.022 --> 00:00:58.103
Miss Shelly laughed.

12
00:01:01.204 --> 00:01:03.645
"We're going to make something better than coffee.

13
00:01:04.706 --> 00:01:08.847
We're going to make our very own Kids Central energy bars.

14
00:01:13.129 --> 00:01:15.690
Everyone, gather around this big bowl."

15
00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:23.934
We're making our own snack!"

16
00:01:24.394 --> 00:01:25.074
Bobby said.

17
00:01:25.094 --> 00:01:28.296
"We'll make the mixture all together.

18
00:01:29.472 --> 00:01:31.053
The instructions are on the board."

19
00:01:31.073 --> 00:01:40.621
"Step 1: Empty one can of condensed milk and two tablespoons of oil into a bowl.

20
00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.943
Stir," Miss Shelly read.

21
00:01:44.424 --> 00:01:46.705
Nina picked up an open can on the table.

22
00:01:46.725 --> 00:01:49.428
"Here is the condensed milk."

23
00:01:53.891 --> 00:01:54.772
"I've got the oil."

24
00:01:56.552 --> 00:02:00.174
Jason measured two tablespoons of oil and poured them into the bowl.

25
00:02:00.774 --> 00:02:09.337
"Stir!" 2: Add two cups of toasted oats.

26
00:02:09.837 --> 00:02:13.619
Stir." Nina picked up a bag of toasted oats.

27
00:02:13.639 --> 00:02:16.360
"How much is two cups?"

28
00:02:17.601 --> 00:02:19.361
Bobby handed her a measuring cup.

29
00:02:19.381 --> 00:02:21.722
"Fill this up twice."

30
00:02:21.742 --> 00:02:25.844
"One. Two.

31
00:02:26.316 --> 00:02:28.117
There!" Nina grinned.

32
00:02:28.137 --> 00:02:30.117
"This is fun."

33
00:02:30.137 --> 00:02:35.839
"Step 3: Add one cup of puffed wheat.

34
00:02:36.379 --> 00:02:41.060
Stir." Jason measured one cup and added it to the mixing bowl.

35
00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.141
"Cool. That was easy."

36
00:02:45.321 --> 00:02:48.942
"Step 4: Add half a cup of chopped nuts.

37
00:02:51.723 --> 00:02:53.504
Where are the chopped nuts, Miss Shelly?"

38
00:02:53.904 --> 00:02:54.664
Izzie asked.

39
00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.081
"Here are the chopped nuts.

40
00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:01.224
We're using sliced almonds."

41
00:03:02.345 --> 00:03:04.307
Miss Shelly handed her the bag of nuts.

42
00:03:06.449 --> 00:03:07.790
Izzie added them to the mix.

43
00:03:09.732 --> 00:03:12.534
"Step 5: Make it sweet.

44
00:03:13.656 --> 00:03:17.119
Add chocolate chips and raisins," Nina read.

45
00:03:17.139 --> 00:03:20.402
"Ooh, I love raisins."

46
00:03:25.164 --> 00:03:32.590
"Don't forget step 6: Add one cup of sunflower seeds," Miss Shelly reminded them.

47
00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:36.233
"And don't forget to stir, stir, stir!"

48
00:03:36.714 --> 00:03:37.354
Izzie said.

49
00:03:37.374 --> 00:03:42.338
"I am stirring, stirring, stirring," Nina said.

50
00:03:42.358 --> 00:03:45.961
"Spread onto a greased baking pan.

51
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:49.404
How do you grease the pan, Miss Shelly?"

52
00:03:49.764 --> 00:03:50.525
Bobby asked.

53
00:03:50.545 --> 00:03:55.104
"Pour some oil onto a paper towel," she answered.

54
00:03:55.124 --> 00:03:58.986
"Then rub it around the bottom of the pan.

55
00:04:00.346 --> 00:04:02.307
Miss Shelly gave him a paper towel.

56
00:04:14.272 --> 00:04:16.773
we press the mixture down like this."

57
00:04:18.034 --> 00:04:21.235
Miss Shelly pressed her palms firmly on top of the mixture.

58
00:04:21.255 --> 00:04:23.936
"We're ready to bake!"

59
00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.523
Miss Shelly lifted the pan into the toaster oven.

60
00:04:29.543 --> 00:04:36.730
"Bake for 25 minutes at 175 degrees Celsius," Bobby said.

61
00:04:41.454 --> 00:04:43.356
will we do for 25 minutes?"

62
00:04:43.917 --> 00:04:44.718
Jason asked.

63
00:04:44.738 --> 00:04:47.140
"Let's play soccer.

64
00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.482
Girls versus boys!"

65
00:04:49.983 --> 00:04:50.844
Bobby shouted.

66
00:05:00.084 --> 00:05:01.765
"Yeah! Boys win!"

67
00:05:02.265 --> 00:05:04.086
Jason and Bobby slapped hands.

68
00:05:06.787 --> 00:05:10.108
"Mmm Something smells good!"

69
00:05:10.528 --> 00:05:11.369
Bobby cried.

70
00:05:11.389 --> 00:05:13.570
"It's our snack!"

71
00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:14.970
Miss Shelly said.

72
00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.931
"It's ready for the final step."

73
00:05:17.951 --> 00:05:22.213
"Cut into bars and enjoy," Bobby read.

74
00:05:22.233 --> 00:05:24.354
"That means eat!

75
00:05:25.575 --> 00:05:28.576
Maybe staying inside isn't so bad after all."

76
00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.241
Miss Shelly cut 12 bars.

77
00:05:35.362 --> 00:05:36.763
Everyone took an energy bar.

78
00:05:36.783 --> 00:05:40.967
"Wow. We made a really good snack!"

79
00:05:41.527 --> 00:05:42.187
Izzie said.

80
00:05:46.731 --> 00:05:50.073
And now I have lots of energy," added Bobby.

81
00:05:50.093 --> 00:05:52.796
"Let's go play more soccer!"
